  "description": "DnsClientX is an async C# library for DNS over UDP, TCP, HTTPS (DoH), TLS\n            (DoT), HTTP/3 (DoH3), and QUIC (DoQ). It also has a PowerShell module that can be\n            used to query DNS records. It provides a simple way to query DNS records using\n            multiple DNS providers. It supports multiple DNS record types and parallel queries.\n            It's available for .NET 8, .NET 10, .NET Standard 2.0, and .NET Framework 4.7.2.",
